# 版本钉死见 scripts/cep/parity/parity_config.json;构建入口 = scripts/cep/parity/build_gem5.sh
external/gem5/
external/gem5-v25/

# gem5 运行产物(per scripts/cep/parity/run_parity.sh)
m5out/

# 2026-11-09(per 台账 Entry #306):**session-bootstrap 的 paste-ready prompt** 是
# **session-local 产物**(per `rdd-session-bootstrap` skill §What NOT to do:
# 「❌ commit `last-bootstrap-prompt.md` (session-local, gitignored)」)⇒ 必须忽略。
last-bootstrap-prompt.md
